    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e4ffe86a-c750-469c-967d-23bb4a0aaf8c"],
 " in terms of master integrals (or themselves), or 2) find a direct \
expression for the sum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
